<%# The square photo a details page shows in the left part of its identity card.

    Local contract:
      photo - the Photo record, already known to carry a file
      name  - the record's own name, used as the image's alternative text

    A stored photo is always a 300x300 square, so it is rendered at that
    aspect ratio and never stretched. The alternative text names the record
    rather than describing the picture, because the picture is the record. %>
<figure class="record-photo mb-0">
  <%= image_tag url_for(photo.file),
    alt: t("shared.record_photo.alt", name: name),
    class: "record-photo-image",
    width: Photo::SIZE,
    height: Photo::SIZE %>
</figure>
